{
  "slug": "stephen-a-smith-sends-strong-message-to-kwame-brown",
  "postId": 74041,
  "title": "Stephen A Smith Sends Strong Message to Kwame Brown",
  "htmlContent": "<!-- wp:image {\"id\":511792,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/hi-res-4e93002e86a9c6a326839f4623be98b4_crop_north.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-511792\"/><figcaption><em>Rachel Luna/Getty Images</em></figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Kwame Brown has made numerous headlines over the past couple of weeks thanks to his banter with Charlamagne Tha God, Matt Barnes, Stephen Jackson, and Stephen A. Smith.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Brown has had enough of the constant slander around his name, and it is easy to understand why. He has been denigrated throughout his career and has had enough of being challenged by everyone.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Recently, <a href=\"https://twitter.com/stephenasmith/status/1394770128357793802?s=20\">Smith noted that he would not reply to Kwame</a> because he has the right to feel whatever he wants. However, Smith has since gone back to this promise. On Smith's Disney Plus show, Stephen A's World, he decided to react to a reel of Brown, which shows him making numerous blunders on the court.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/shannonsharpeee/status/1398035654739517440?s=20\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true,\"className\":\"\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/shannonsharpeee/status/1398035654739517440?s=20\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Brown told Smith to meet him in Seattle for a mutual combat fight a couple of weeks ago.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>\"Meet me in Seattle, where we can have mutual combat and talking like that. It will look like a toupee on the front of your head how hard I'll slap the back of your head MF.\"</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/LandonBuford/status/1394681781010501641?s=20\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true,\"className\":\"\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/LandonBuford/status/1394681781010501641?s=20\n</div><figcaption><gwmw style=\"display:none;\"></figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>On Thursday, <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dIEtl71DE58\">Brown responded</a> and said that Smith's highlights were when he was injured.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
